0..80 Comment "//! A functor over a theory\'s models: a parameter written `(S : Model(T))` takes"
81..161 Comment "//! the signature the theory `T` derives, its sorts abstract in the body and its"
162..242 Comment "//! operations values at the types the theory states, and an application matches"
243..323 Comment "//! its argument against that signature by name, so a module ascribed the record"
324..404 Comment "//! signature the theory presents is an argument as a model is. After Kaposi and"
405..412 Comment "//! Xie"
413..506 Comment "//! [Kaposi-2024-secondorder_generalised_algebraic_theories_signatures_firstorder_semantics],"
507..584 Comment "//! under which a module signature is a theory and a parameterised module the"
585..614 Comment "//! static half of a functor."
615..618 Comment "//!"
619..635 Comment "//! - see: #1226"
636..672 Comment "//! - see: #1764 — `Reassociating`"
673..774 Comment "//! - cites: [Kaposi-2024-secondorder_generalised_algebraic_theories_signatures_firstorder_semantics]"
775..778 Comment "//!"
